<p>Creates a circle of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> at your feet; the circle protects you from silence effects while you remain in its radius while silencing and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">16, 22, 27, 30, 34</acronym> light damage to everyone else who enters. The circle lasts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p>